-- ============================================================================
-- Migration 70 DOWN: no-op.
--
-- Migration 70 defines the `note_about` edge table as
-- ``TYPE RELATION FROM note TO source`` (the shape Track NS's note→source
-- auto-link needs) and adds its fields (`similarity_score`, `method`,
-- `created_at`). It is a forward-only schema definition with no faithful
-- inverse (mirrors migrations 66/67/68/69's down):
--   * reverting `note_about` to TYPE ANY would re-break
--     ``RELATE note -> note_about -> source`` — exactly the correctness 70
--     establishes; and
--   * `note_about` is a DERIVED, regenerated projection (the auto-link
--     orchestrator clears and re-relates a note's source links) — the edge
--     table holds no canonical state worth a destructive rollback, and on this
--     corpus it is empty until the auto-link runs.
-- Down intentionally does nothing; mirrors migrations 66/67/68/69's down
-- convention.
-- ============================================================================
